                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a supremely lovely picross puzzler, simple to use, works well on touchscreens, works well with the mouse, and the editor to create puzzles and post them to the workshop is super easy to use as is playing workshop puzzles, providing genuinely unlimited potential for gameplay. There is one small hiccup where viewing workshop puzzle details causes the program to freeze, but aside from that, it runs like a breeze. Lots of screen configurations, too.",
